{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(生写真のナース！憧れだった！嬉)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログでは\nたくさんの方々に\n『卒業おめでとう！』って頂き、\n本当に嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業式から数日経ちましたが、\nまだ学生じゃなくなったと\nいう実感は湧きません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、、、\n気付いたら今日は3月31日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とうとう\nもう1つのお別れの日が\nやってきてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、タイトルにもある通り"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生証です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学から約10年間、\n私のお財布を支えてくれた\n学生証様。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう学割が使えなくなるなんて、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから、\n映画もカラオケも夢の国も\nお財布に厳しくなっていくんですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ、娯楽が一気に遠ざかる\n気がします、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが大人の階段ってやつ\nですか、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは息抜きのための\nプチ贅沢に娯楽を\n楽しみたいと思います、、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までありがとう！\n学生割引、、、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！\n通常料金！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは大人の支払いに\n慣れなくては、、、！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて！\n話は変わりますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、4月1日から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ちに待った\n8枚目シングルの\nイオンモールキャンペーン\nが始まります(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昇格後、初めての握手会だし\nアンダー楽曲の制作や\n乃木どこや、\n乃木ここ、\n乃木のの\nなど\nお話したいことが\n沢山あります(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに皆さんに\n会うのはとっても緊張しますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に楽しみましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましてさんも\nお久ぶりさんも\nいつもの皆さんも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東近郊にお住まいの方は\n是非遊びに来て下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ3月28日で2期生は\n1周年を迎えました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの経験が出来た\n1年目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にあっと言う間でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2年目に入った\n私たちもよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで、\n今日は七海が作ってくれた\n2期生1周年の記念画像で\nお別れです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いやつめ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"p.s.\n川後さん、まいまいさん\nお誕生日おめでとうございます(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後さんは\n本当に喋りが上手くて、、、♡\nまた一緒にラジオやりたいな～！\nそしてあわよくば\nあだ名を付けて貰えるくらい\n仲良くなりたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいさんは\nいつもお世話になってます(>_<)\n最近なかなかお仕事でも\n会えていないので寂しいです！\nまたご飯行きましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも良い1年に\nなりますように、、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/31/7639547/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ\nまた更新します！"}],"source":"archive"}